                        <item xml:id="a4"> <locus target="#170v"/>
                           <desc type="Supplication">Supplication. The note mentions <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15200WaldaAbeyaEgzi">Walda ʾAbǝya ʾƎgziʾ</persName>, possibly the name of a former owner.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez"> ወልደ፡ አብየ፡ እግዚእ፡ ከማሁ፡ ግበር፡ ለገብርኩ፡ ወልደ፡ አብየ፡ እግዚእ፡</q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a5"> 
                           <locus target="#170v"/>
                           <desc type="OwnershipNote">Ownership note, written in the same hand as <ref target="#a1"/>. It states that the book belongs to 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15197KidanaMaryam"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Kidāna Māryām</persName> of Māy Bāhrā (cp. <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC4601Maryam">Māryām Bāḥǝrā</placeName>).</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez"> ዝዳዊት፡ ዘአባ፡ ኪዳነ፡ ማርያም፡ ማይ፡ ባህራ፡</q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a6"> 
                           <locus target="#188ra"/>
                           <desc type="Supplication">Supplication; it is crudely written in the same hand as <ref target="#a1"/> and <ref target="#a5"/>.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ሰዓሊነ፡ ሰአሊነ፡ ማርያም፡ እምነ፡ ወእሙ፡ ለእግዚእነ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        <item xml:id="a7"> 
                           <locus from="188ra" to="188rb4"/>
                           <desc type="Asmat">ʾAsmat-prayer for the supplicant <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15201GabraMaryam"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Gabra Māryām</persName>; it is written by the same crude hand as <ref target="#d2"/>, and is difficult to read. That is why the text provided below may contain errors.</desc>
                              <q xml:lang="gez"> ከለሜናት፡ ኢላማናጢስ፡ ማሩዱኤል፡ ኢያብሐን፡ ፀፁ፡ ቀለፀ፡ ሐዱኤል፡ ከፈረዙን፡ አማኑኤል፡ ማሰያስ፡ ዝንቱ፡ አስማቲከ፡ ዘአጽናዕኩ፡ አይንድፍ፡ ወዘኢያጽናዕኩ፡ ከመ፡ አጽናዕ፡ አነ፡ ገበረ፡ ማርያም፡ በ <gap reason="illegible" resp="MK"/> 
                                 በርበሬ፡ ፯፡ ቀን፡ ድግም፡ ሳታሳጉል፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a8"> 
                           <locus target="#188rb"/>
                           <desc type="GuestText">Excerpt from <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4308Prayer">Prayers for the morning</title>; it is crudely written in the same hand as <ref target="#a7"/>.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩፡ አምላክ፡ ስቡሕ፡ ወውዱስ፡ ዘሣረረ፡ ኵሎ፡ ዓለመ፡ በአሐቲ፡ ቃል፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></q>
                        </item>
                           
                        <item xml:id="a9"> 
                           <locus target="#188vb"/>
                           <desc type="Directive">Directives for the ministers (?); the note is very crudely written in the same hand as <ref target="#a7"/>, <ref target="#a8"/> and <ref target="#d2"/>.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a10"> 
                           <locus target="#188vb"/>
                           <desc type="GuestText"> <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT5679MagicPrayer">Ṣalot baʾǝnta lǝssāna sabʾ zamad</title>; it is crudely written; the last line is written in column ‘a’ of the same folium.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">በሰመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩አምላክ፡ ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ ልሳን፡ ዘመድ፡ ወባእድ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a11"> 
                           <locus target="#189vb"/>
                           <desc type="Record">Record concerning loans or transactions (?), incomplete. The note is written in Amharic; a few words have been washed out.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="am"/>
                           </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e1">
                           <locus target="#1r"/>
                           <desc>The internal number of the monastic library, 374.</desc>
                        </item>

                        <item xml:id="e2">
                           <locus target="#3r"/>
                           <desc>Shelfmark C3-IV-234</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e3">
                           <locus target="#1r"/>
                           <desc>The incipit of the Pauline <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3515Epistle">Epistle to the Romans</title>, written possibly by <ref target="#h1"/>.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e4">
                           <locus target="#1r"/>
                           <desc> The title, <foreign xml:lang="gez">መዝሙረ፡ ዳዊት፡</foreign>, is written with black paint.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e5">
                           <locus target="#171ra"/>
                           <desc>The name <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15200WaldaAbeyaEgzi">Walda ʾAbǝya ʾƎgziʾ</persName>, the same name as in <ref target="#a4"/>, is written in reddish-brown ink over an erased name.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e6">
                           <locus target="#183va"/>
                           <desc>The name of a former donor or owner has been effaced.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e7">
                           <locus target="#189v"/>
                           <desc>A long note has been effaced.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e8">
                           <desc>The Psalms are divided into groups of fifty, separated with a line of alternating black and red dots.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e9">
                           <locus target="#19r #181r"/>
                           <desc>The scribe used compressed script to accommodate lines written over erasure.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e10">
                           <locus target="#19r #150v"/>
                           <desc>Part of the line is taken up.</desc>
                        </item>
                           
                        <item xml:id="e11">
                           <locus target="#5v #22v #35v #80r #105r #157r #164v #183r"/>
                           <desc type="Correction">Omitted letters, words, lines or passages inserted interlineally. The folia listed above are a few examples.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e12">
                           <locus target="#17v #31v #60v #80r #122r"/>
                           <desc type="Correction">Omitted letters added at the beginning of the line. The folia listed above are a few examples.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e13">
                           <locus target="#10r #43v #53v #91r #146v #157v #171v"/>
                           <desc type="Correction">Many corrections written over erasures by <ref target="#h1"/>. The folia listed above are a few examples.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e14">
                           <locus target="#7v #37r #46r #60r #105v #121v #160r #171v"/>
                           <desc type="Correction">Many erasures marked with thin black and red lines. The folia listed above are a few examples.</desc>
                        </item>
                           
                        <item xml:id="e15">
                           <locus target="#39v #46r #49r #60r #69v #150r #158rv #160r #184v"/>
                           <desc type="Correction">Many erasures. The folia listed above are a few examples.</desc>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="e16">
                           <locus target="#1v #10v #140v"/>
                           <desc>Pen trial.</desc>
                        </item>
                   
                     </list>
                  </additions>
                  <bindingDesc>
                     <binding contemporary="partly">
